{"file_name": "4c7f9e2fda29f02c.pdf", "category": "hr", "text": "Samuel Stephen | Experienced HR Generalist\n\n& (625)-984-0045 \u2018J sam.ste1980@gmail.com in Sam Stephen\n\nDriven HR generalist with 6+ years of experience, possessing great expertise in staff coaching, training, development,\nand engagement. Looking to invigorate the corporate culture at Masus Corporation.\n\nSKILLS\n\nHR best practices Leadership\n\nTalent acquisition Collaboration\n\nStaff coaching & mentoring Communication\nEmployee relations & diversity Interpersonal skills\nWorkforce planning & development Meeting management\n\nWORK EXPERIENCE\n\nHR Generalist IVEE Group * 03/2016 - 7/2020\n\ne Enhanced managerial performance up to 33% through benchmarking and streamlining the system for\nemployee records.\nExecuted a program to foster employee engagement within the corporate, having achieved 100%\nemployee participation.\nIntegrated 20+ staff in the aftermath of 2 acquisitions, steering flawless workforce assimilation into\ncore business operations. Contributed to profitable turnaround with >$1M in first-year savings.\n\nStaffing & Recruitment Associate VNG Ltd. * 2/2012 - 12/2015\n\n\u00a2 Handled all aspects of the recruitment and staffing procedures for a 400-employee company.\n\n\u00a2 Controlled corporate repositioning, guided recruitment of 100+ technical management staff for US HQ.\n\n\u00a2 Supported the company's long-term growth and expansion by managing and executing hiring policies,\nprocedures and innovative technology.\n\nEDUCATION\n\nSan Diego State University 2008 - 2012\n\nBachelor's Degree in HRM", "embedding": [-0.07579094916582108, 0.009336670860648155, 0.045571040362119675, 0.028068674728274345, -0.030473852530121803, -0.01146356388926506, -0.003426558105275035, 0.015350784175097942, -0.04211006686091423, -0.00956804770976305, -0.03927219659090042, 0.01791253313422203, 0.039328839629888535, 0.0022308386396616697, 0.003148408140987158, 0.008745329454541206, -0.00585785787